 "proposed_wording": "POST HOC, different regime: on the same 110 PlanBench Blocksworld-hard instances, re-scored by the same local VAL, the frozen BWM S-beam with the self-distilled proposer (H2) solved 88 and DeepSeek-R1's zero-shot direct answer (published per-instance file, step 0) 59 (paired +36/-7, exact McNemar Holm p 5.4e-05, 12 contrasts); the original B2 S-beam solved 73 (+30/-16, Holm p 0.108, not significant). The regimes differ: R1 is a general model with no domain training, no learned simulator and no search; BWM is trained on generated Blocksworld problems.",
