 "status": "POST HOC: not pre-registered; written after every BWM hard result was known. Different regime: the published systems are general zero-shot reasoning models given PDDL text, one answer per instance, no domain training, no learned simulator, no search; the BWM systems are a 0.6B core with LoRA adapters trained on generated Blocksworld problems, planning without execution feedback. Never to be worded 'beats' / 'outperforms o1/R1 at planning'.",
